@startuml walkthrough-commit
title One order, one request
participant "Your code" as You
participant "Aggregate session" as S
database "SPARQL store" as DB
You -> S : get order 42
S -> DB : fetch order 42 with its lines
You -> S : add a line, change a quantity
You -> S : commit
S -> DB : one update: version check, new values,\ncommit record, events
S -> DB : is my commit record there?
alt yes
  S --> You : committed
else no
  S --> You : conflict: order 42 changed since you loaded it
end
@enduml
